description:
 1. Amendment No 1: The contract period is extended for One year, starting from 05/01/2024 up to 04/01/2025 according to the User Department request and ITC resolution all herewith attached.
2.  The contract is signed after the procuring entity  has  received  the  performance security. Refer to Article  109 subsection 3 of Ministerial order N° 001/23/10/TC of 10/10/2023  establishing Regulations governing public Procurement stipulates that; The amount of the performance security may be a percentage of the contract value as follows: (c)  7% of the contract price whose value is between FRW 50,000,000 to FRW 100,000,000; 

Therefore, the service provider shall provide a Performance Security equal to seven percent (7%) of the Contract Price instead of five percent (5%) as done in initial contract because the total contract value is 83,544,000 FRW.

