description:
Based on Article 10 of Law N° 031/2022 of 21/11/2022 Governing Public Procurement which states “the Public Tender Committee and its responsibilities on point 6 regarding providing recommendations on any change to be carried out on the procurement contract” and based on the assessment of the reason presented by the contract manager for the contract extension; 
Based on the above context, the Public Tender Committee recommends extending the contract between RP and ASSETIP/RWANDA for the “Supervision of rehabilitation and renovation (refurbishment) works for the rooms designated to host smart classrooms and smart labs at IPRC Huye, IPRC Kigali, Nyamata TVET School, and EFA Nyagahanga.” This extension should be effective from 17/05/2025 to 17/07/2025.

All other terms and conditions of the contract shall remain unchanged, except for the payment terms, which require separate review and negotiation. This adjustment is necessary due to the incomplete fulfillment of the agreed deliverables under the initial contract.

